Code Server is starting in an Apptainer container on a compute node. Sessions
usually start within a minute, but a busy queue can delay one for several
minutes before this card turns green.

When the course environment is available, the integrated terminal has it on
`PATH` and course packages need no extra setup. If it is missing or not
working, the session still starts without it and the session log says so —
course packages will not import until teaching staff repair it. Workspace
trust is disabled so the Claude Code extension loads automatically. Files
under `/scratch` are fast working space and are purged on a schedule; keep
anything you need in your home directory.

Claude Code and Codex are preinstalled. Sign in with your own account in a
terminal — no shared credentials are built into the image.
